      "id": "claim_dd15e4e31633414d9b7bd9464173ee1f",
      "statement": "Three response format strategies are available: ToolStrategy (converts schema to artificial tool, forces tool calling), ProviderStrategy (delegates validation to model provider's native API), and AutoStrategy (defers selection until runtime based on model capabilities).",
      "evidence": [
