      "id": "claim_131ad8c43ffd427ca47673533b2e53ee",
      "statement": "ToolStrategy wraps schema as StructuredTool with JSON schema as args_schema, adds tool to model with tool_choice='any', parses model's tool call arguments via TypeAdapter, and returns parsed result in structured_response state with optional validation error retry.",
