      "statement": "ProviderStrategy sends schema in provider-specific format (e.g., OpenAI's response_format with json_schema type) via model.bind(), receives JSON response, parses via json.loads(), validates against schema via TypeAdapter, and stores in structured_response; no validation retry occurs.",
